      "means": "Only root will be able to change /etc/profile.d/x\u001b[2Jy.sh, which root trusts. The group 0 and everyone can no longer write there; if that was deliberate \u2014 a deploy group, say \u2014 give them a directory root does not run anything from instead. Its contents were written by someone who could write it: inspect them, or reinstall the file from its package, before you rely on it.",
      "needs_root": true,
